    <div class="entry-content" set:html={`<p>ดังที่เราทุกคนรู้, <a href="/th/product-category/sesame-series/">งา</a> <span class ="tr_" id="tr_0" data-source="" data-orig="is one of the common food materials and ingredients in our lives">is one of the common food materials and ingredients in our lives</span>. อุดมไปด้วยสารอาหารและสามารถนำไปใช้ในการทำอาหารและรักษาโรคได้. ในตลาด, เรามักจะเจองาที่ปอกเปลือกกับงาที่ไม่ปอกเปลือก. ไม่ว่าจะสำหรับการอบ, การทำอาหาร, หรือประโยชน์ต่อสุขภาพ, <span class ="tr_" id="tr_1" data-source="" data-orig="sesame is an essential and delicious ingredient">sesame is an essential and delicious ingredient</span>. <span class ="tr_" id="tr_2" data-source="" data-orig="But do you really understand the differences between shelled and unshelled sesame">But do you really understand the differences between shelled and unshelled sesame</span>? วันนี้, <span class ="tr_" id="tr_3" data-source="" data-orig="let&#8217;s delve into the characteristics and uses of both types of sesame">let&#8217;s delve into the characteristics and uses of both types of sesame</span>!</p><figure id="attachment_565-2" aria-describedby="caption-attachment-565-2" style="width: 749px" class="wp-caption alignnone"><img src="/images/Hulled-Sesame-Seeds-vs-Unhulled-Sesame-Seeds-300x187.jpg" decoding="async" class=" wp-image-565" alt="Hulled Sesame Seeds vs Unhulled Sesame Seeds" width="759" height="473" title="เมล็ดงาขาว VS เมล็ดงาขาวไม่ปอกเปลือก 5 ด้าน 5" /><figcaption id="caption-attachment-565-2" class="wp-caption-text"><span class ="tr_" id="tr_4" data-source="" data-orig="Hulled Sesame Seeds vs Unhulled Sesame Seeds">Hulled Sesame Seeds vs Unhulled Sesame Seeds</span></figcaption></figure><div id="ez-toc-container" class="ez-toc-v2_0_85 counter-hierarchy ez-toc-counter ez-toc-grey ez-toc-container-direction"><div class="ez-toc-title-container"><p class="ez-toc-title" style="cursor:inherit">สารบัญ</p>
<span class="ez-toc-title-toggle"><a href="#" class="ez-toc-pull-right ez-toc-btn ez-toc-btn-xs ez-toc-btn-default ez-toc-toggle" aria-label="Toggle Table of Content"><span class="ez-toc-js-icon-con"><span class=""><span class="eztoc-hide" style="display:none;">สลับ</span><span class="ez-toc-icon-toggle-span"><svg style="fill: #999;color:#999" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" class="list-377408" width="20px" height="20px" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none"><path d="M6 6H4v2h2V6zm14 0H8v2h12V6zM4 11h2v2H4v-2zm16 0H8v2h12v-2zM4 16h2v2H4v-2zm16 0H8v2h12v-2z" fill="currentColor"></path></svg><svg style="fill: #999;color:#999" class="arrow-unsorted-368013" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="10px" height="10px" viewBox="0 0 24 24" version="1.2" baseProfile="tiny"><path d="M18.2 9.3l-6.2-6.3-6.2 6.3c-.2.2-.3.4-.3.7s.1.5.3.7c.2.2.4.3.7.3h11c.3 0 .5-.1.7-.3.2-.2.3-.5.3-.7s-.1-.5-.3-.7zM5.8 14.7l6.2 6.3 6.2-6.3c.2-.2.3-.5.3-.7s-.1-.5-.3-.7c-.2-.2-.4-.3-.7-.3h-11c-.3 0-.5.1-.7.3-.2.2-.3.5-.3.7s.1.5.3.7z"/></svg></span></span></span></a></span></div><nav><ul class='ez-toc-list ez-toc-list-level-1 ' ><li class='ez-toc-page-1 ez-toc-heading-level-2'><a class="ez-toc-link ez-toc-heading-1" href="#What_do_Hulled_and_Unhulled_Mean" ><span class ="tr_" id="tr_5" data-source="" data-orig="What do Hulled and Unhulled Mean">What do Hulled and Unhulled Mean</span>?</a></li><li class='ez-toc-page-1 ez-toc-heading-level-2'><a class="ez-toc-link ez-toc-heading-2" href="#Can_Both_White_and_Black_Sesame_Be_Made_into_Shelled_or_Unshelled_Products" ><span class ="tr_" id="tr_6" data-source="" data-orig="Can Both White and Black Sesame Be Made into Shelled or Unshelled Products">Can Both White and Black Sesame Be Made into Shelled or Unshelled Products</span>?</a></li><li class='ez-toc-page-1 ez-toc-heading-level-2'><a class="ez-toc-link ez-toc-heading-3" href="#Is_Unhulled_White_Sesame_Better" ><span class ="tr_" id="tr_7" data-source="" data-orig="Is Unhulled White Sesame Better">Is Unhulled White Sesame Better</span>?</a></li><li class='ez-toc-page-1 ez-toc-heading-level-2'><a class="ez-toc-link ez-toc-heading-4" href="#Do_Hulled_and_Unshelled_Sesame_Have_the_Same_Nutritional_Content" ><span class ="tr_" id="tr_8" data-source="" data-orig="Do Hulled and Unshelled Sesame Have the Same Nutritional Content">Do Hulled and Unshelled Sesame Have the Same Nutritional Content</span>?</a></li><li class='ez-toc-page-1 ez-toc-heading-level-2'><a class="ez-toc-link ez-toc-heading-5" href="#Is_Shelled_Sesame_More_Expensive_Than_Unshelled_Sesame" ><span class ="tr_" id="tr_9" data-source="" data-orig="Is Shelled Sesame More Expensive Than Unshelled Sesame">Is Shelled Sesame More Expensive Than Unshelled Sesame</span>?</a></li><li class='ez-toc-page-1 ez-toc-heading-level-2'><a class="ez-toc-link ez-toc-heading-6" href="#Unhulled_Black_Sesame_vs_Unhulled_White_Sesame_Which_is_Better" ><span class ="tr_" id="tr_10" data-source="" data-orig="Unhulled Black Sesame vs">Unhulled Black Sesame vs</span>. <span class ="tr_" id="tr_11" data-source="" data-orig="Unhulled White Sesame">Unhulled White Sesame</span>: <span class ="tr_" id="tr_12" data-source="" data-orig="Which is Better">Which is Better</span>?</a></li><li class='ez-toc-page-1 ez-toc-heading-level-2'><a class="ez-toc-link ez-toc-heading-7" href="#Which_is_Better_for_Industrial_Production_of_Sesame_Oil_Hulled_Sesame_Seeds_vs_Unhulled_Sesame_Seeds" ><span class ="tr_" id="tr_13" data-source="" data-orig="Which is Better for Industrial Production of Sesame Oil">Which is Better for Industrial Production of Sesame Oil</span>: <span class ="tr_" id="tr_14" data-source="" data-orig="Hulled Sesame Seeds vs Unhulled Sesame Seeds">Hulled Sesame Seeds vs Unhulled Sesame Seeds</span>?</a></li></ul></nav></div><h2><span class="ez-toc-section" id="What_do_Hulled_and_Unhulled_Mean"></span><span class ="tr_" id="tr_15" data-source="" data-orig="What do Hulled and Unhulled Mean">What do Hulled and Unhulled Mean</span>?<span class="ez-toc-section-end"></span></h2><p>อันดับแรก, <span class ="tr_" id="tr_16" data-source="" data-orig="let’s clarify the definitions of “shelled” and “unshelled.” Shelled sesame">let’s clarify the definitions of “shelled” and “unshelled.” Shelled sesame</span>, <span class ="tr_" id="tr_17" data-source="" data-orig="as the name suggests">as the name suggests</span>, <span class ="tr_" id="tr_18" data-source="" data-orig="still has its hard outer shell">still has its hard outer shell</span>, <span class ="tr_" id="tr_19" data-source="" data-orig="which serves as a natural protective layer for the seeds during growth">which serves as a natural protective layer for the seeds during growth</span>. <span class ="tr_" id="tr_20" data-source="" data-orig="Unshelled sesame has had this outer shell removed">Unshelled sesame has had this outer shell removed</span>, <span class ="tr_" id="tr_21" data-source="" data-orig="leaving only the golden sesame seeds">leaving only the golden sesame seeds</span>, <span class ="tr_" id="tr_22" data-source="" data-orig="which appear more enticing and have a finer texture">which appear more enticing and have a finer texture</span>.</p><h2><span class="ez-toc-section" id="Can_Both_White_and_Black_Sesame_Be_Made_into_Shelled_or_Unshelled_Products"></span><span class ="tr_" id="tr_23" data-source="" data-orig="Can Both White and Black Sesame Be Made into Shelled or Unshelled Products">Can Both White and Black Sesame Be Made into Shelled or Unshelled Products</span>?<span class="ez-toc-section-end"></span></h2><p><span class ="tr_" id="tr_24" data-source="" data-orig="The answer is yes">The answer is yes</span>! <span class ="tr_" id="tr_25" data-source="" data-orig="Both white and black sesame can be processed into either shelled or unshelled products">Both white and black sesame can be processed into either shelled or unshelled products</span>. <span class ="tr_" id="tr_26" data-source="" data-orig="Generally">Generally</span>, งาดำ, <span class ="tr_" id="tr_27" data-source="" data-orig="due to its darker color">due to its darker color</span>, <span class ="tr_" id="tr_28" data-source="" data-orig="appears fuller when shelled">appears fuller when shelled</span>, <span class ="tr_" id="tr_29" data-source="" data-orig="so many people prefer shelled black sesame">so many people prefer shelled black sesame</span>. ดังนั้น, <span class ="tr_" id="tr_30" data-source="" data-orig="most black sesame products in the market are shelled">most black sesame products in the market are shelled</span>. <span class ="tr_" id="tr_31" data-source="" data-orig="On the other hand">On the other hand</span>, <span class ="tr_" id="tr_32" data-source="" data-orig="unshelled white sesame looks cleaner and neater">unshelled white sesame looks cleaner and neater</span>, <span class ="tr_" id="tr_33" data-source="" data-orig="making it more suitable for direct consumption or dessert-making">making it more suitable for direct consumption or dessert-making</span>, <span class ="tr_" id="tr_34" data-source="" data-orig="so unshelled white sesame is also quite common in the market">so unshelled white sesame is also quite common in the market</span>.</p><h2><span class="ez-toc-section" id="Is_Unhulled_White_Sesame_Better"></span><span class ="tr_" id="tr_35" data-source="" data-orig="Is Unhulled White Sesame Better">Is Unhulled White Sesame Better</span>?<span class="ez-toc-section-end"></span></h2><p><span class ="tr_" id="tr_36" data-source="" data-orig="Both shelled and unshelled white sesame have their own merits">Both shelled and unshelled white sesame have their own merits</span>; <span class ="tr_" id="tr_37" data-source="" data-orig="the choice mainly depends on your usage scenario and personal preference">the choice mainly depends on your usage scenario and personal preference</span>. <span class ="tr_" id="tr_38" data-source="" data-orig="Here are the advantages of each">Here are the advantages of each</span>:</p><ul><li><strong><span class ="tr_" id="tr_39" data-source="" data-orig="Shelled White Sesame">Shelled White Sesame</span>:</strong> <span class ="tr_" id="tr_40" data-source="" data-orig="Retains the original flavor and nutrients of sesame">Retains the original flavor and nutrients of sesame</span>; <span class ="tr_" id="tr_41" data-source="" data-orig="the shell can add texture and aroma during cooking">the shell can add texture and aroma during cooking</span>. นอกจากนี้, <span class ="tr_" id="tr_42" data-source="" data-orig="shelled sesame is generally more stable during storage and less prone to moisture damage">shelled sesame is generally more stable during storage and less prone to moisture damage</span>.</li><li><strong><span class ="tr_" id="tr_43" data-source="" data-orig="Unshelled White Sesame">Unshelled White Sesame</span>:</strong> <span class ="tr_" id="tr_44" data-source="" data-orig="Has a finer texture">Has a finer texture</span>, <span class ="tr_" id="tr_45" data-source="" data-orig="making it suitable for baking and making sauces where a delicate texture is desired">making it suitable for baking and making sauces where a delicate texture is desired</span>. <span class ="tr_" id="tr_46" data-source="" data-orig="Unshelled sesame also releases its aroma more easily during cooking">Unshelled sesame also releases its aroma more easily during cooking</span>, <span class ="tr_" id="tr_47" data-source="" data-orig="enhancing the dish’s flavor">enhancing the dish’s flavor</span>.</li></ul><figure id="attachment_567-2" aria-describedby="caption-attachment-567-2" style="width: 757px" class="wp-caption alignnone"><img src="/images/Hulled-Sesame-Seeds-vs-Unhulled-Sesame-Seeds-1-300x193.jpg" decoding="async" class=" wp-image-567" alt="Hulled Sesame Seeds vs Unhulled Sesame Seeds" width="767" height="493" title="เมล็ดงาขาว VS เมล็ดงาขาวไม่ปอกเปลือก 5 ด้าน 6" /><figcaption id="caption-attachment-567-2" class="wp-caption-text"><span class ="tr_" id="tr_48" data-source="" data-orig="Hulled Sesame Seeds vs Unhulled Sesame Seeds">Hulled Sesame Seeds vs Unhulled Sesame Seeds</span></figcaption></figure><h2><span class="ez-toc-section" id="Do_Hulled_and_Unshelled_Sesame_Have_the_Same_Nutritional_Content"></span><span class ="tr_" id="tr_49" data-source="" data-orig="Do Hulled and Unshelled Sesame Have the Same Nutritional Content">Do Hulled and Unshelled Sesame Have the Same Nutritional Content</span>?<span class="ez-toc-section-end"></span></h2><p><span class ="tr_" id="tr_50" data-source="" data-orig="From a nutritional perspective">From a nutritional perspective</span>, <span class ="tr_" id="tr_51" data-source="" data-orig="there is no significant difference in the nutrient composition between shelled and unshelled sesame">there is no significant difference in the nutrient composition between shelled and unshelled sesame</span>. ทั้งสองอุดมไปด้วยโปรตีน, ไขมัน, เส้นใยอาหาร, วิตามิน, และแร่ธาตุ. อย่างไรก็ตาม, <span class ="tr_" id="tr_52" data-source="" data-orig="because shelled sesame retains the complete structure of the seeds">because shelled sesame retains the complete structure of the seeds</span>, <span class ="tr_" id="tr_53" data-source="" data-orig="it may have slight advantages in certain trace elements and antioxidants">it may have slight advantages in certain trace elements and antioxidants</span>.</p><table style="border-collapse: collapse; width: 100%;" border="1"><thead><tr><th><span class ="tr_" id="tr_54" data-source="" data-orig="Nutritional Components">Nutritional Components</span></th><th><span class ="tr_" id="tr_55" data-source="" data-orig="Hulled Sesame">Hulled Sesame</span></th><th><span class ="tr_" id="tr_56" data-source="" data-orig="Unhulled Sesame">Unhulled Sesame</span></th><th>หมายเหตุ</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>ไขมัน</td><td>สูง (เกี่ยวกับ 40-60%)</td><td>สูง (เกี่ยวกับ 50-55%)</td><td><span class ="tr_" id="tr_57" data-source="" data-orig="One of sesame&#8217;s main components">One of sesame&#8217;s main components</span>, <span class ="tr_" id="tr_58" data-source="" data-orig="mostly unsaturated fatty acids beneficial for cardiovascular health">mostly unsaturated fatty acids beneficial for cardiovascular health</span>.</td></tr><tr><td>โปรตีน</td><td><span class ="tr_" id="tr_59" data-source="" data-orig="Rich">Rich</span> (เกี่ยวกับ 17-25%)</td><td><span class ="tr_" id="tr_60" data-source="" data-orig="Rich">Rich</span> (เกี่ยวกับ 20-25%)</td><td><span class ="tr_" id="tr_61" data-source="" data-orig="Important nutrient">Important nutrient</span>, <span class ="tr_" id="tr_62" data-source="" data-orig="provides essential amino acids for the body">provides essential amino acids for the body</span>.</td></tr><tr><td>ใยอาหาร</td><td><span class ="tr_" id="tr_63" data-source="" data-orig="More">More</span> (<span class ="tr_" id="tr_64" data-source="" data-orig="due to high fiber in the shell">due to high fiber in the shell</span>)</td><td><span class ="tr_" id="tr_65" data-source="" data-orig="Less but still present">Less but still present</span></td><td>ใยอาหารช่วยส่งเสริมสุขภาพของลำไส้.</td></tr><tr><td>วิตามินอี</td><td><span class ="tr_" id="tr_66" data-source="" data-orig="Rich">Rich</span> (<span class ="tr_" id="tr_67" data-source="" data-orig="high content">high content</span>)</td><td><span class ="tr_" id="tr_68" data-source="" data-orig="Effective antioxidant">Effective antioxidant</span>, <span class ="tr_" id="tr_69" data-source="" data-orig="helps improve blood circulation and metabolism">helps improve blood circulation and metabolism</span>.</td><td></td></tr><tr><td>แร่ธาตุ (เช่น, <span class ="tr_" id="tr_70" data-source="" data-orig="Calcium">Calcium</span>, เหล็ก)</td><td><span class ="tr_" id="tr_71" data-source="" data-orig="Rich">Rich</span>, <span class ="tr_" id="tr_72" data-source="" data-orig="contains calcium">contains calcium</span>, เหล็ก, สังกะสี, ฟอสฟอรัส, แมกนีเซียม, ฯลฯ.</td><td><span class ="tr_" id="tr_73" data-source="" data-orig="Rich in various minerals beneficial for health">Rich in various minerals beneficial for health</span>.</td><td></td></tr><tr><td><span class ="tr_" id="tr_74" data-source="" data-orig="Other Antioxidants">Other Antioxidants</span> (เช่น, <span class ="tr_" id="tr_75" data-source="" data-orig="Sesamin">Sesamin</span>)</td><td><span class ="tr_" id="tr_76" data-source="" data-orig="Present and relatively high">Present and relatively high</span>, <span class ="tr_" id="tr_77" data-source="" data-orig="such as sesamin">such as sesamin</span>, <span class ="tr_" id="tr_78" data-source="" data-orig="sesamolin">sesamolin</span>, วิตามินบี, ฯลฯ.</td><td><span class ="tr_" id="tr_79" data-source="" data-orig="Present and relatively high">Present and relatively high</span>, <span class ="tr_" id="tr_80" data-source="" data-orig="such as sesamin">such as sesamin</span>, <span class ="tr_" id="tr_81" data-source="" data-orig="sesamolin">sesamolin</span>, แอนโทไซยานิน, <span class ="tr_" id="tr_82" data-source="" data-orig="melanin">melanin</span>, ฯลฯ.</td><td><span class ="tr_" id="tr_83" data-source="" data-orig="Helps reduce cholesterol and protect cardiovascular health">Helps reduce cholesterol and protect cardiovascular health</span>.</td></tr></tbody></table><p><span class ="tr_" id="tr_84" data-source="" data-orig="From the component table">From the component table</span>, <span class ="tr_" id="tr_85" data-source="" data-orig="we can see that the nutritional contents of shelled and unshelled sesame are quite similar">we can see that the nutritional contents of shelled and unshelled sesame are quite similar</span>, <span class ="tr_" id="tr_86" data-source="" data-orig="though there are differences in trace elements and other antioxidants">though there are differences in trace elements and other antioxidants</span>.</p><h2><span class="ez-toc-section" id="Is_Shelled_Sesame_More_Expensive_Than_Unshelled_Sesame"></span><span class ="tr_" id="tr_87" data-source="" data-orig="Is Shelled Sesame More Expensive Than Unshelled Sesame">Is Shelled Sesame More Expensive Than Unshelled Sesame</span>?<span class="ez-toc-section-end"></span></h2><p><span class ="tr_" id="tr_88" data-source="" data-orig="In terms of price">In terms of price</span>, <span class ="tr_" id="tr_89" data-source="" data-orig="there is no fixed price difference between shelled and unshelled sesame">there is no fixed price difference between shelled and unshelled sesame</span>. <span class ="tr_" id="tr_90" data-source="" data-orig="This mainly depends on market supply and demand">This mainly depends on market supply and demand</span>, <span class ="tr_" id="tr_91" data-source="" data-orig="origin">origin</span>, <span class ="tr_" id="tr_92" data-source="" data-orig="variety">variety</span>, <span class ="tr_" id="tr_93" data-source="" data-orig="and processing costs">and processing costs</span>. <span class ="tr_" id="tr_94" data-source="" data-orig="In certain areas or specific time periods">In certain areas or specific time periods</span>, <span class ="tr_" id="tr_95" data-source="" data-orig="shelled sesame may be slightly cheaper due to lower processing costs">shelled sesame may be slightly cheaper due to lower processing costs</span>. ในทางกลับกัน, <span class ="tr_" id="tr_96" data-source="" data-orig="unshelled sesame might be more popular due to its finer texture and convenience">unshelled sesame might be more popular due to its finer texture and convenience</span>, <span class ="tr_" id="tr_97" data-source="" data-orig="potentially making it more expensive">potentially making it more expensive</span>. ดังนั้น, <span class ="tr_" id="tr_98" data-source="" data-orig="shelled sesame is not necessarily more expensive than unshelled sesame">shelled sesame is not necessarily more expensive than unshelled sesame</span>.</p><figure id="attachment_568-2" aria-describedby="caption-attachment-568-2" style="width: 766px" class="wp-caption alignnone"><img